# Bark notification config
#
# Copy this file to <device>.bark.env and replace the placeholder URL with your
# Bark URL template. The real *.bark.env file is ignored by Git.
#
# Use $0 where the URL-encoded message body should go. The notifier prefixes
# every message with the app name and version, and forces level=passive.

https://api.day.app/YOUR_DEVICE_KEY/$0
